<sect2 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" id="gimp-filter-posterize">
  <title>Posterizar</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Cores</primary>
    <secondary>Posterizar</secondary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Posterizar</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <sect3>
    <title>Visão geral</title>

    <figure>
      <title>Exemplo para o filtro <quote>Posterizar</quote></title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/base-examples/sunflower.png"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Imagem original</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>

      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/menus/colors/posterize-ex.png"/>
        </imageobject>

        <caption>
          <para><quote>Posterizar</quote> com 3 níveis aplicados</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>

    <para>Esta ferramenta é projetada para pesar de forma inteligente as cores de pixel da seleção ou camada ativa e reduzir o número de cores enquanto mantém uma semelhança com as características da imagem original.</para>
  </sect3>



  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <para>
      You can access this command from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Colors</guimenu>
        <guimenuitem>Posterize…</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>Opções</title>
    <figure>
      <title>Diálogo do filtro Posterizar</title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/menus/colors/posterize.png"/>
        </imageobject>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
    <variablelist>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Predefinições</term>
        <term>Opções de Mistura</term>
        <term>Preview</term>
        <term>Merge filter</term>
        <term>Split view</term>
        <listitem>
          <xi:include href="about-common-features.xml"/>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Níveis de Posterização</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>Aqui, <quote>nível</quote> significa <quote>número de cores por canal</quote>.</para>
          <para>
            This slider and the <guilabel>+</guilabel> and
            <guilabel>-</guilabel> buttons allow you
            to set the number of levels (2-256) in each RGB channel that
            the tool uses to describe the active layer. The maximum total 
            number of colors is the combination of these levels. A level of 3
            will give 3<superscript>3</superscript> = 27 colors.
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
  </sect3>

</sect2>
